1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,200
I don't want nobody to get killed

2
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:22,780
I come and get you, I'm always ready to fight

3
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:29,140
So don't take all of the blame where all is spread

4
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:32,860
Oh, I don't take all of the blame, you always do

5
00:00:32,860 --> 00:00:36,620
There will always be something you cannot control

6
00:00:36,620 --> 00:00:40,880
We will overcome, your salvation has begun

7
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:46,720
No sun, no light, such a mess, I love them

8
00:00:46,720 --> 00:00:54,860
Don't kill your heart, you make me realize who I need

9
00:00:54,860 --> 00:00:59,660
I'll be there, hold on, the changes to power

10
00:00:59,660 --> 00:01:02,540
So where are you now?

11
00:01:03,140 --> 00:01:07,280
I'll reach you, my top, the shadows of the earth

12
00:01:07,280 --> 00:01:10,400
Illusions are born

13
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:15,920
The golden end is still wrong, but I know it's a pain

14
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:19,140
That makes us a human after all

15
00:01:19,140 --> 00:01:22,140
Toin to save you for the control

16
00:01:22,140 --> 00:01:24,040
About your precious worth

17
00:01:24,040 --> 00:01:27,640
This scar may respond to your call

18
00:01:27,640 --> 00:01:44,400
Today, we've gathered all nobles with the progenitors' blood to address a growing concern

19
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:45,280
Humans!

20
00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:52,000
The Japanese Imperial Demon Army has been wrapping up operations and increasing their numbers in northern Tokyo

21
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:55,500
This human organization is killing our brothers

22
00:01:55,500 --> 00:01:56,680
Human organization?

23
00:01:56,680 --> 00:02:00,060
Explaining their territory and flirting with forbidden enchantments to increase their power

24
00:02:00,060 --> 00:02:05,100
According to our intel, they are once again experimenting on the Seraph of the End

25
00:02:05,100 --> 00:02:09,720
If we allow these humans to continue to rise and gain strength

26
00:02:09,720 --> 00:02:13,520
Another plague like the one that occurred eight years ago will surely come to pass

27
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:15,580
You needn't worry about that

28
00:02:15,580 --> 00:02:21,560
Because we're exterminating the Japanese Imperial Demon Army

29
00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:24,880
We're going to war

30
00:02:24,880 --> 00:02:29,800
To ensure that we continue to rule this world

31
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:33,740
We'll have to slaughter the greedy livestock resistance once and for all

32
00:02:33,740 --> 00:02:38,800
Extermination

33
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:40,740
The Seraph of the End

34
00:02:40,740 --> 00:02:42,520
Don't worry you

35
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:44,800
I'm coming to your rescue soon

36
00:02:44,800 --> 00:02:52,300
That's all I have to report from block three, sir

37
00:02:52,300 --> 00:02:59,440
I'm Imperial Demon Army Major General Shinya Hiragi

38
00:02:59,440 --> 00:03:02,900
I'll be covering reports from the Kansai region

39
00:03:02,900 --> 00:03:05,900
Several of them concern suspicious vampire activity

40
00:03:05,900 --> 00:03:07,600
Among other things

41
00:03:07,600 --> 00:03:11,920
Ichinose

42
00:03:11,920 --> 00:03:14,140
Hey, quit sawing logs

43
00:03:14,140 --> 00:03:15,100
Huh?

44
00:03:15,100 --> 00:03:21,340
Are we finally done with this boring-ass meeting?

45
00:03:21,340 --> 00:03:25,580
Drop the attitude, Gurren

46
00:03:25,580 --> 00:03:28,420
You're not as special as you might think

47
00:03:28,420 --> 00:03:29,520
Sorry, General

48
00:03:29,520 --> 00:03:31,840
It's just so hard to remember that

49
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:34,680
When I'm surrounded by the dullest personalities in the army

50
00:03:34,680 --> 00:03:35,900
Is that so?

51
00:03:36,380 --> 00:03:37,660
Well, I can beat the lesson into you

52
00:03:37,660 --> 00:03:38,660
Pardon me, sir

53
00:03:38,660 --> 00:03:40,940
Ichinose's attitude is nothing new to this room

54
00:03:40,940 --> 00:03:43,800
Now, as I was saying

55
00:03:43,800 --> 00:03:45,860
I'm taking it off

56
00:03:45,860 --> 00:03:49,420
You can send me all of the information later

57
00:03:49,420 --> 00:03:51,120
Come on, Gurren

58
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:53,060
I can't defend you forever

59
00:03:53,060 --> 00:03:55,920
You're gonna have to adjust your attitude sooner or later

60
00:03:55,920 --> 00:03:58,940
Huh?

61
00:03:59,200 --> 00:04:01,200
I never ask you to defend me

62
00:04:01,200 --> 00:04:05,160
You Hiragis control the Imperial Demon Army

63
00:04:05,160 --> 00:04:07,520
You don't need a second-class Ichinose hanging around

64
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:09,320
So, I'm out

65
00:04:09,320 --> 00:04:11,460
I've got some sleep to catch up on

66
00:04:11,460 --> 00:04:14,840
At least you know your place, deadweight

67
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:17,900
We'll handle things like we always have

68
00:04:17,900 --> 00:04:19,420
Without you

69
00:04:19,420 --> 00:04:21,600
It's a wonder humanity's still kicking

70
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:22,760
Later

71
00:04:22,760 --> 00:04:40,880
Feels like I lost a few brain cells

72
00:04:40,880 --> 00:04:43,400
You can't hide from me today, Gurren!

73
00:04:44,840 --> 00:04:50,380
There's no beating around the bush with you

74
00:04:50,380 --> 00:04:56,500
It's kind of refreshing after dealing with pointless politics all day

75
00:04:56,500 --> 00:04:58,800
You know what I'm after

76
00:04:58,800 --> 00:05:01,440
Now quit wasting my time and give me a cursed gear

77
00:05:01,440 --> 00:05:02,560
I can handle the demon

78
00:05:02,560 --> 00:05:03,900
Oh, yeah?

79
00:05:04,140 --> 00:05:06,640
Does this have anything to do with getting vengeance for your family?

80
00:05:06,880 --> 00:05:07,420
Of course

81
00:05:07,420 --> 00:05:10,120
It's the only thing I've lived for ever since you brought me here

82
00:05:10,120 --> 00:05:11,900
We need to get you a date

83
00:05:11,900 --> 00:05:12,740
Soon

84
00:05:12,740 --> 00:05:16,740
I better pacify this idiot before he makes a scene

85
00:05:16,740 --> 00:05:19,120
Last thing I need is him getting the Hiragi's attention

86
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:23,480
Fine

87
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:26,000
Let's go make a contract with the demon

88
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:29,080
Then, you'll join us on the front line

89
00:05:29,080 --> 00:05:29,720
Huh?

90
00:05:29,980 --> 00:05:31,060
No joke?

91
00:05:31,060 --> 00:05:32,100
Sure, why not?

92
00:05:32,340 --> 00:05:34,100
I don't care if you haven't finished your training

93
00:05:34,100 --> 00:05:37,520
That way it's your fault if you die

94
00:05:37,520 --> 00:05:40,900
Like we need to worry about that happening

95
00:05:40,900 --> 00:05:41,800
I'm a badass

96
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:44,220
I'll be slaying monsters from dusk till dawn

97
00:05:44,220 --> 00:05:47,500
You really are an idiot, huh?

98
00:05:48,820 --> 00:05:50,960
Oh, and there's one more thing, you

99
00:05:50,960 --> 00:05:51,340
Huh?

100
00:05:52,500 --> 00:05:55,120
That's for trying to kick a superior officer

101
00:05:55,120 --> 00:06:02,600
The burdens of command can really take it out of you

102
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:06,480
But I've got to admit

103
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:09,120
Things are getting a lot less boring around here

104
00:06:09,120 --> 00:06:21,400
What happened to your head?

105
00:06:21,780 --> 00:06:24,640
Let me guess, you skipped class and got into another fight?

106
00:06:25,020 --> 00:06:26,040
What's it to you?

107
00:06:26,380 --> 00:06:29,020
You should know, Gurren doesn't pull any punches by now

108
00:06:29,020 --> 00:06:31,540
Um, why'd you ask if you knew?

109
00:06:32,140 --> 00:06:32,940
It's fun

110
00:06:32,940 --> 00:06:35,520
Congrats, by the way

111
00:06:35,520 --> 00:06:37,660
On the demon contract

112
00:06:37,660 --> 00:06:40,020
He finally approved it, didn't he?

113
00:06:40,620 --> 00:06:42,240
Yeah, but you know him

114
00:06:42,240 --> 00:06:44,680
He makes a choice on a whim and doesn't follow through

115
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:45,900
You can't fool me

116
00:06:45,900 --> 00:06:48,320
I can tell you're nearly bursting at the seams

117
00:06:48,320 --> 00:06:49,780
No, I'm not

118
00:06:49,780 --> 00:06:53,920
Don't worry about it

119
00:06:53,920 --> 00:06:57,140
Lieutenant Colonel Gurren may have a razor-sharp tongue

120
00:06:57,140 --> 00:06:58,960
And a general fondness for brutality

121
00:06:58,960 --> 00:07:01,640
But he always keeps his promises

122
00:07:01,640 --> 00:07:04,300
Finally

123
00:07:04,300 --> 00:07:05,940
It's happening

124
00:07:05,940 --> 00:07:10,600
I'll get the power to kill those parasites

125
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:27,040
The time is near

126
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:30,400
You must be overjoyed

127
00:07:30,400 --> 00:07:34,460
It won't be long until you get the chance to see your precious angel again

128
00:07:34,460 --> 00:07:38,540
I have such high hopes for you, Mika

129
00:07:38,540 --> 00:07:39,600
I have such high hopes for you, Mika

130
00:07:39,600 --> 00:07:41,800
You're certainly fellow

131
00:07:42,080 --> 00:07:58,580
I have such high hopes for our own

132
00:07:58,640 --> 00:07:59,960
Thank god

133
00:07:59,960 --> 00:08:29,160
Come on, hurry!

134
00:08:29,960 --> 00:08:39,960
It's all right.

135
00:08:59,960 --> 00:09:14,960
Alright, pay attention.

136
00:09:14,960 --> 00:09:18,960
I've already finished grading your written exams, so I'll just be handing those out and

137
00:09:18,960 --> 00:09:20,960
calling it a day, okay?

138
00:09:20,960 --> 00:09:24,960
Remember, this score is crucial to your overall Cursed Gear ranking.

139
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:27,960
The way you perform in class is just as important as in training.

140
00:09:27,960 --> 00:09:32,960
I expect those of you with less than passing grades to put extra effort into your studies

141
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:35,960
from now on.

142
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:40,960
Let me see!

143
00:09:40,960 --> 00:09:41,960
Give it back!

144
00:09:41,960 --> 00:09:42,960
Oh, wow!

145
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:43,960
Would you look at the score?

146
00:09:43,960 --> 00:09:44,960
How impressive!

147
00:09:44,960 --> 00:09:45,960
Hey, cut it out!

148
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:48,960
You've really outdone yourself.

149
00:09:48,960 --> 00:09:52,960
They say only superhumans can get a score like this!

150
00:09:52,960 --> 00:09:54,960
What being such a pest?

151
00:09:54,960 --> 00:09:56,960
Don't you want to share it?

152
00:09:56,960 --> 00:09:58,960
You should be so proud!

153
00:09:58,960 --> 00:10:05,960
Give that back to me!

154
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:07,960
How'd he get zero points?

155
00:10:07,960 --> 00:10:09,960
That takes a special kind of dumb.

156
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:11,960
Whoa, that's crazy!

157
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:17,960
I thought my handwriting sucked, but this guy takes the pain.

158
00:10:17,960 --> 00:10:19,960
What's your problem?

159
00:10:19,960 --> 00:10:21,960
Can't you find someone else to annoy?

160
00:10:21,960 --> 00:10:24,960
Now is that any way to talk to a lady?

161
00:10:24,960 --> 00:10:26,960
Especially one who's trying to help you fit in.

162
00:10:26,960 --> 00:10:28,960
You could try to show some gratitude.

163
00:10:28,960 --> 00:10:31,960
You can take your gratitude and choke on it!

164
00:10:31,960 --> 00:10:33,960
I'll tell you what I keep telling Gurren.

165
00:10:33,960 --> 00:10:35,960
I don't need friends to stick it to the bloodsuckers.

166
00:10:35,960 --> 00:10:36,960
Are we clear?

167
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:38,960
Yeah, we're as clear as crystal.

168
00:10:38,960 --> 00:10:43,960
Just don't come crying to me when you realize that you're completely worthless by yourself.

169
00:10:43,960 --> 00:10:44,960
Oh, yeah?

170
00:10:44,960 --> 00:10:47,960
I'll kill 50 of those fangs with my eyes closed.

171
00:10:47,960 --> 00:10:49,960
Said the childish fool.

172
00:10:49,960 --> 00:10:51,960
You're a childish fool!

173
00:10:51,960 --> 00:10:53,960
Come on, it makes sense that you failed.

174
00:10:53,960 --> 00:10:54,960
Huh?

175
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:56,960
Sorry, that didn't come out like I meant it to.

176
00:10:56,960 --> 00:11:00,960
I'm just saying that since you spent several years as a prisoner of the vampires,

177
00:11:00,960 --> 00:11:04,960
your Japanese reading and writing skills aren't as strong as your English and Latin are.

178
00:11:04,960 --> 00:11:06,960
So, it makes sense that you failed.

179
00:11:06,960 --> 00:11:10,960
Uh, well, yeah, that goes without saying.

180
00:11:10,960 --> 00:11:13,960
That excuse is crappier than your test score, huh?

181
00:11:13,960 --> 00:11:16,960
How would you know?

182
00:11:16,960 --> 00:11:20,960
Then what's your score?

183
00:11:20,960 --> 00:11:23,960
It better be epic or I'll pop you in for being an arrogant ass.

184
00:11:23,960 --> 00:11:26,960
Come on, Four Eyes, let's see how smart you really are.

185
00:11:26,960 --> 00:11:28,960
See for yourself.

186
00:11:28,960 --> 00:11:31,960
Latin, English, and Japanese spellcraft.

187
00:11:31,960 --> 00:11:32,960
Easy stuff.

188
00:11:32,960 --> 00:11:35,960
Foreign languages aren't even my strong suit.

189
00:11:35,960 --> 00:11:38,960
I should be no match for a seasoned study abroad poser like you.

190
00:11:38,960 --> 00:11:42,960
How about I use you for vamp-killing practice?

191
00:11:42,960 --> 00:11:43,960
Yeah, tough guy.

192
00:11:43,960 --> 00:11:45,960
Come on, let's see you try.

193
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:49,960
You, please stop fighting.

194
00:11:49,960 --> 00:11:51,960
Waiter, are you too scared to throw a crotch?

195
00:11:51,960 --> 00:11:54,960
By the way, I still haven't dismissed you from class yet.

196
00:11:54,960 --> 00:11:56,960
Go ahead, open your stupid mouth one more time.

197
00:11:56,960 --> 00:11:58,960
I can do the world a favor and end you right here.

198
00:11:58,960 --> 00:12:01,960
Hey, I can hear you morons halfway down the hall.

199
00:12:01,960 --> 00:12:02,960
What's the deal?

200
00:12:02,960 --> 00:12:15,960
Welcome back, Lieutenant Colonel Gurren.

201
00:12:15,960 --> 00:12:17,960
I hope everything went well.

202
00:12:17,960 --> 00:12:19,960
As well as you'd expect.

203
00:12:19,960 --> 00:12:21,960
What else is new?

204
00:12:21,960 --> 00:12:24,960
Anyway, is there a reason for all the racket?

205
00:12:24,960 --> 00:12:25,960
Those two.

206
00:12:25,960 --> 00:12:29,960
I should have known.

207
00:12:29,960 --> 00:12:32,960
Wait, let's put this on hold for now.

208
00:12:32,960 --> 00:12:34,960
Gurren's come out of hiding.

209
00:12:34,960 --> 00:12:35,960
What's the deal?

210
00:12:35,960 --> 00:12:38,960
I thought you said I was gonna get to contract with a demon.

211
00:12:38,960 --> 00:12:40,960
How much longer do I have to wait-

212
00:12:40,960 --> 00:12:41,960
Let me do the talking.

213
00:12:41,960 --> 00:12:42,960
Way too loud.

214
00:12:42,960 --> 00:12:46,960
With all due respect, I think you owe us an explanation.

215
00:12:46,960 --> 00:12:48,960
You have an obligation to this class,

216
00:12:48,960 --> 00:12:52,960
but you left for over ten days without any regard for your students.

217
00:12:52,960 --> 00:12:55,960
I think giving us some cursed gear would make up for that.

218
00:12:55,960 --> 00:12:57,960
Really?

219
00:12:57,960 --> 00:13:02,960
You think a bunch of dumbass losers like you have what it takes to tangle with a demon, huh?

220
00:13:02,960 --> 00:13:03,960
No doubt about it.

221
00:13:03,960 --> 00:13:06,960
The only dumbass in here is Kimizuki.

222
00:13:06,960 --> 00:13:07,960
I won't fail.

223
00:13:07,960 --> 00:13:09,960
Your test score says otherwise.

224
00:13:09,960 --> 00:13:11,960
I won't ask for your opinion.

225
00:13:21,960 --> 00:13:23,960
So, what's your assessment?

226
00:13:23,960 --> 00:13:26,960
Can this class resist the demon's temptation?

227
00:13:26,960 --> 00:13:27,960
Hmm.

228
00:13:27,960 --> 00:13:29,960
Well, there's always room for improvement.

229
00:13:29,960 --> 00:13:32,960
But those two are much stronger than I was at 16.

230
00:13:32,960 --> 00:13:34,960
I think they could do it.

231
00:13:34,960 --> 00:13:35,960
What about the others?

232
00:13:35,960 --> 00:13:37,960
There are a few contenders.

233
00:13:37,960 --> 00:13:40,960
But Yoichi Saotume takes the cake.

234
00:13:40,960 --> 00:13:43,960
He has a surprisingly high stability against demons.

235
00:13:43,960 --> 00:13:44,960
Really?

236
00:13:44,960 --> 00:13:46,960
Okay then.

237
00:13:46,960 --> 00:13:49,960
Why don't we give it a shot now?

238
00:13:49,960 --> 00:13:52,960
It's less complicated that way.

239
00:13:52,960 --> 00:13:53,960
No!

240
00:13:53,960 --> 00:13:55,960
You can't do that in the classroom!

241
00:13:55,960 --> 00:13:56,960
Oh my!

242
00:13:56,960 --> 00:13:57,960
Are you planning to attack?

243
00:13:57,960 --> 00:13:59,960
This sure got interesting fast.

244
00:13:59,960 --> 00:14:01,960
Hope you're ready, kids.

245
00:14:03,960 --> 00:14:07,960
If you die from this, blame yourselves for not training hard enough.

246
00:14:07,960 --> 00:14:08,960
No!

247
00:14:27,960 --> 00:14:28,960
Dude!

248
00:14:28,960 --> 00:14:29,960
What the hell is going on?

249
00:14:29,960 --> 00:14:31,960
It feels just like...

250
00:14:31,960 --> 00:14:33,960
My heart's been squeezed.

251
00:14:34,960 --> 00:14:36,960
What's wrong with everyone?

252
00:14:37,960 --> 00:14:42,960
I think that's enough for now.

253
00:14:42,960 --> 00:14:44,960
I think that's enough for now.

254
00:15:01,960 --> 00:15:02,960
Alright, good.

255
00:15:02,960 --> 00:15:04,960
If you're still conscious, you've got a chance.

256
00:15:04,960 --> 00:15:05,960
Make no mistake.

257
00:15:05,960 --> 00:15:06,960
You've got a long way to go.

258
00:15:06,960 --> 00:15:09,960
But if you continue to train and study your spellcraft,

259
00:15:09,960 --> 00:15:12,960
you could move into the contract ceremony for a cursed gear.

260
00:15:12,960 --> 00:15:14,960
The five of you that are still on your feet?

261
00:15:14,960 --> 00:15:16,960
You just turned yourself four stars.

262
00:15:16,960 --> 00:15:19,960
You'll get to try out for a black demon series cursed gear.

263
00:15:19,960 --> 00:15:21,960
The same rank of weapon as my sword.

264
00:15:23,960 --> 00:15:24,960
Well...

265
00:15:24,960 --> 00:15:25,960
I guess there's only three.

266
00:15:25,960 --> 00:15:26,960
I guess there's only three.

267
00:15:27,960 --> 00:15:28,960
You.

268
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:30,960
Kimizuki.

269
00:15:31,960 --> 00:15:32,960
And Yoichi.

270
00:15:35,960 --> 00:15:37,960
I wish you had passed out.

271
00:15:39,960 --> 00:15:42,960
Dealing with demons is like a day at the beach for you, isn't it?

272
