I say welcome.

328
00:17:56,960 --> 00:17:57,960
I'll stay the same.

329
00:17:57,960 --> 00:18:10,340
All right, let's keep moving people time for the ceremony

330
00:18:27,960 --> 00:18:39,140
Hey, getting cold feet now isn't gonna help

331
